# 1640s (2026-10-18): dragoons - mounted shot that ride to cover and shoot from it.
drill "Dragoons"
era 1640s
about "Mounted shot: ride fast to a hedge or a wall, shoot from it, and ride off from anything that charges."
type Dragoon
dials aggression 0.30 discipline 0.50 cohesion 0.40 cover 0.80 patience 0.40 nerve 0.50

sergeant:
  when enemy charging and enemy within 35                -> fall back 40
  when enemy within 55                                   -> hold; find cover; fire at will
  otherwise                                              -> advance fast; find cover; hold fire

man:
  when enemy within 50 and loaded                        -> fire
  otherwise                                              -> follow sergeant
